@INPROCEEDINGS{Mose2606:Multi,
AUTHOR="Lukas Moser and Paolo D'Angelo and Berk Celik and Fabrice Locment and
Manuela Sechilariu",
TITLE="{Multi-Energy} Microgrids: Components, Objectives, and Optimization Methods",
BOOKTITLE="2026 International Congress on Smart Agriculture and Sustainable Systems
Engineering (SmartAgri\&SuSY 2026)",
ADDRESS="Tirana, Albania",
DAYS=6,
MONTH=jun,
YEAR=2026,
ABSTRACT="This paper presents a literature review and conceptual framework for
multi-energy microgrids, synthesizing their concept, components,
objectives, and optimization methods within the energy hub paradigm. It
examines applications across residential, agricultural and industrial
sectors, highlighting sector coupling through conversion technologies like
